  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 8.7.x\n### All packages\n* Added .NET 10 TFM\n* Updated to C# Language Version 14\n* Converted extension methods to C# 14 extension members\n* Removed deprecated code\n* Enabled Trim Analyzer for package\n* Marked package with ``<IsTrimmable>`` set to true.\n\n\n### Memory package\n* Added .NET Standard 2 int fallback methods for ``IncrementedNumberRange``\n* Converted Span ``IsEmpty`` extension method to C# 14 extension property\n* Converted ``IsEmptyOrWhitespace`` extension method to C# 14 static extension member method",
